  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Welcome, World Explorer!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "Let's explore the world and everything in it! This is a **check-in**, not a test. Tell a grown-up what you already know."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "emoji": "🌍",
      "alt": "Our home planet",
      "caption": "Our home planet"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Stop 1: Our planet"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "We live on planet **Earth**. Most of Earth is covered by water in big **oceans**. The land is split into seven big areas called **continents**. The Sun is a star that gives us light and heat."
    },
    {
      "type": "check",
      "question": {
        "type": "multiple_choice",
        "prompt": "What do we call the big areas of land on Earth?",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "a",
            "text": "Continents"
          },
          {
            "id": "b",
            "text": "Pools"
          },
          {
            "id": "c",
            "text": "Houses"
          }
        ],
        "answer": [
          "a"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Stop 2: Time"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "There are **7 days** in a week and **12 months** in a year. The days are Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday, Saturday and Sunday. A day has 24 hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "check",
      "question": {
        "type": "number",
        "prompt": "How many days are in a week?",
        "answer": {
          "value": 7,
          "tolerance": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "activity",
      "title": "My week",
      "materials": [
        "paper",
        "crayons"
      ],
      "instructions": [
        "Draw 7 boxes for the days of the week.",
        "Draw one thing you do on each day.",
        "Which day is your favourite and why?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "explainer",
      "title": "Why we have day and night",
