        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Stop 3: People who help us"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "**Doctors** and **nurses** keep us healthy. **Teachers** help us learn. **Firefighters** put out fires. **Farmers** grow our food. Every job helps the community."
    },
    {
      "type": "check",
      "question": {
        "type": "multiple_choice",
        "prompt": "Who helps us when we are ill?",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "a",
            "text": "Doctor"
          },
          {
            "id": "b",
            "text": "Baker"
          },
          {
            "id": "c",
            "text": "Pilot"
          }
        ],
        "answer": [
          "a"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Stop 4: Food and health"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "To stay healthy we eat fruit, vegetables, and drink water, sleep well and wash our hands. Sweets and fizzy drinks are only for treats."
    },
    {
      "type": "check",
      "question": {
        "type": "multiple_choice",
        "prompt": "Which of these is the healthiest snack?",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "a",
            "text": "An apple"
          },
          {
            "id": "b",
            "text": "A bag of sweets"
          },
          {
            "id": "c",
            "text": "A fizzy drink"
          }
        ],
        "answer": [
          "a"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Stop 5: Amazing animals"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "The **blue whale** is the biggest animal in the world. The **cheetah** is the fastest land animal. Camels can live in hot deserts and polar bears live in the cold Arctic."
    },
    {
      "type": "reveal",
      "prompt": "Which animal would you like to meet, and why?",
      "answer_markdown": "Any answer is great! Ask a grown-up to help you find out more."
    },
    {
      "type": "brain_game",
      "game": "memory_match",
      "title": "Match the explorers",
      "goal": "Find the matching pairs.",
      "emojis": [
        "🌍",
        "🐋",
        "🐆",
        "🌾",
        "🍎",
        "🐘"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "summary",
      "points": [
        "Earth has oceans and 7 continents.",
        "A week has 7 days and a year has 12 months.",
        "Many people do jobs that help the community.",
        "Healthy habits keep us strong.",
        "Animals live in lots of different places."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "callout",
